"""
MCP Research Bridge v4 — cached, deduplicated, ranked search + structured research plans.
Zero API keys. Replaces Firecrawl, Exa, Brave Search.

Tools:
  web_search       — cached multi-engine search with fuzzy dedup + ranking
  web_extract      — Trafilatura-powered page extraction
  news_search      — recent news via SearXNG
  scholar_search   — academic papers via arXiv
  research_plan    — structured multi-query research with cross-source synthesis

Caching: TTL-based LRU cache (searches 300s, extracts 600s).
Dedup: Fuzzy title matching (Levenshtein ratio > 0.85).
Ranking: Category-aware scoring (tech boosts GitHub/Reddit/arXiv, news boosts recency).

Transport: stdio (default) or --http-port PORT (llama.cpp WebUI)
Dependencies: Python 3.11+ stdlib. trafilatura/httpx optional.
"""

